            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A mass flow controller includes an inlet configured to receive fluid, a flow path in which the fluid passes, a mass flow sensor configured to provide a signal corresponding to mass flow of the fluid through the flow path; a control valve configured to regulate a flow of the fluid out of an outlet of the mass flow controller; and a spring device between a receiver section of a valve base and the control valve.</p>
